01:38:19,733 --> 01:38:21,331
I was going to stop-by.

1124
01:38:22,708 --> 01:38:24,232
I had a wonderful day...

1125
01:38:26,278 --> 01:38:27,580
and I have you to thank.

1126
01:38:34,573 --> 01:38:35,987
come to bed honey.

