1228
01:49:36,316 --> 01:49:41,299
Leonard...

1229
01:49:41,299 --> 01:49:44,871
always the years between us...

1230
01:49:44,871 --> 01:49:49,558
always the years...

1231
01:49:49,558 --> 01:49:53,387
always...
the love...

1232
01:49:53,872 --> 01:49:55,880
always...

